          "page": 28,
          "text": "<!-- Start of picture text -->\nThere are 3 types of GST credit<br>1.  The Process of IGST- Input Tax Credit utilisation<br>Balance  Balance<br>Balance  if any, if any,<br>if any,<br>IGST-ITC IGST-Liability CGST-Liability Carry forward to<br>next year<br>2.  The Process of CGST- Input Tax Credit utilisation<br>CGST-ITC CGST-Liability IGST-Liability Carry forward to<br>next year<br>3.  The Process of SGST – Input Tax Credit utilisation<br>Carry forward to<br>SGST-Liability IGST-Liability next year<br>SGST-ITC<br><!-- End of picture text -->\n\n2.16",
