          "page": 40,
          "text": "##### **6.16 Table 13 - Documents Issued** \n\nTo Upload the details of Documents issued perform the following steps. \n\n1. Click the Documents Issued tile to add the details of document issued during the current tax period. \n\n\n\n2. To update the document for Invoices for outward supply, Click on Add Document: \n\n\n\n3. Add the details for different categories. You can click ADD DOCUMENT button to add more rows for each category. \n\n4. Click SAVE at the end of the page. \n\n6.34",
